# Coding Style

- Go 1.22+, standard formatting (`gofmt`)
- Package per subsystem under `internal/`
- Files: `interface.go`, `types.go`, implementation, `*_test.go`
- Exported types: document with reference to [docs/contracts/](../docs/contracts/) where applicable
- Errors: wrap with context; no silent swallowing
- No llama.cpp/CGO imports outside future `internal/inference/` adapter
- Match existing code in `internal/process/` for naming and test style
